      <languageTerm type="code">eng</languageTerm>
    </language>
    <abstract type="content" lang="eng">We propose a new score function to compare and evaluate the relative impact of state-of-charge profiles on overall battery lifetime. Our score function, based on on a discrete Fourier transform of the state-of-charge profile, formalizes and generalizes earlier ideas found in the literature, and can form an important help in optimizing overall life time for battery powered systems. In this paper we introduce and illustrate the method, and discuss its merits as well as open issues and related literature.</abstract>
